                    "RTID(DefaultZombieWinCondition@LevelModules)",
                    "RTID(NewWaves@CurrentLevel)"
                ],
                "WrittenBy": "SansGrinder",
                "NameMultiLanguage": {
                    "en": "Epic Quest: Lawn of Embarkation Escapade!",
                    "zh": "史诗任务：启程草坪的奇遇！"
                },
                "StageModule": "RTID(TutorialStage@LevelModules)"
            }
        },
        {
            "aliases": [
                "LEE1_Intro"
            ],
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Heya! It's me, SansGrinder",
                            "zh": "嗨呀，我是衫竹"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "I am one of the two main level designers for the Gardendless: Unofficial EXpansion series =)",
                            "zh": "我是「GE版：非官方拓展拓展系列关」作者之一"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "The Lawn of Embarkation Escapade (LEE) levels are meant to teach you the structure of our levels, and to give you a first impression of what to expect",
                            "zh": "「启程草坪的奇遇」（教程关拓展拓展）是用来告诉你我们的关卡结构并让你对这个系列留下初印象的系列关"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Those levels might be too easy here - they are meant to be! The true challenge comes later in the worlds......",
                            "zh": "你可能觉得这些关可能太简单了，因为就是故意写简单点的。真正的挑战会随着世界的推进慢慢到来……"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Oh, by the way, every Day 1 of a world ALWAYS starts with a no win condition Choose Your Seeds level, and *nearly* every zombie in the world arrives",
                            "zh": "哦对了，每个世界的拓拓第一关都是无条件自选，僵尸方面永远是大阅兵（几乎每种僵尸都会出现）"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Every level in the Unofficial EXpansion series is also intended to be played on Difficulty A - the level might not be easier on a lower difficulty!",
                            "zh": "拓拓系列中的每一关都是为A难度设计的——大部分关没做低难度适配！"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Enjoy the level! I'll see you at the end ;)",
                            "zh": "享受你的教程关吧~ 等你打完了我们接着聊 ;)"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "aliases": [
                "LEE1_Outro"
            ],
            "objclass": "NarrativeProperties",
            "objdata": {
                "Flow": [
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "NPC_ENTER"
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Great job obliterating that level! Hope you liked it, haha......",
                            "zh": "干得好，你打爆了那群僵尸！希望你喜欢这关……"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "......because you might not like the next level, as you will be more restricted there",
                            "zh": "……因为你不一定会喜欢下一关，下一关条件就没这么宽松了"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Curious if you beat the level in the expected way? Here's how we test our levels: ",
                            "zh": "好奇你的解法是不是标准解？那你可以看看我们的测关标准："
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "*MOST* Choose Your Seeds levels BEFORE Kongfu Temple (Trials) can be beaten WITHOUT the use of Plant Food + world plants only + w/o peach+chardguard combo. All of which could be defeated WITHOUT the use of any lawn mowers! ",
                            "zh": "武林寺庙（的试炼）前的绝大多数所有自选卡关卡都可以「纯白 禁叶 不丢车 禁桃菜」"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "Levels in Kongfu Temple (Trials) and after will NOT have an intended world-only solution - not that it won't have one, it is just unintended! Feel free to use anything apart from mints!",
                            "zh": "武林寺庙（的试炼）系列关及之后「不做纯白预设解」——除了薄荷，随便用~\n（不预设纯白解不等于纯白无解）"
                        }
                    },
                    {
                        "Character": "zombossicon",
                        "Action": "SAY",
                        "Lines": {
                            "en": "That's all for now, I'll catch ya in another level =) cya!",
                            "zh": "那就先说这些，另个关卡见 =) 拜拜！"
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
